WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.000 --> 01:02.920
- Get something to tie her up! - Let me go!

3
01:02.920 --> 01:04.520
This time, I'll bind your souls.

4
01:04.520 --> 01:07.913
You'll never be reborn, not in a billion lifetimes!

5
01:10.460 --> 01:14.324
She just fainted, and you took her to the hospital.

6
01:14.324 --> 01:15.890
Yo's test results are in.

7
01:15.890 --> 01:18.494
The drug she was given damaged her nervous system.

8
01:18.494 --> 01:20.425
I told you to use just a little!

9
01:20.425 --> 01:23.706
If anything happens to Yo, I'll go to the police!

10
01:27.720 --> 01:28.906
Yo...

11
01:31.080 --> 01:33.520
Please forgive me, Yo.

12
01:33.520 --> 01:36.320
I promise I'll never do it again.

13
01:36.320 --> 01:38.768
You said you loved me so much.

14
01:38.768 --> 01:40.159
Then prove it.

15
01:40.159 --> 01:43.733
Those two women were in on it with you.

16
01:43.733 --> 01:46.410
Which one will you deal with first?

17
01:49.800 --> 01:51.706
Can't choose?

18
01:53.760 --> 01:55.120
Then...

19
01:56.568 --> 01:58.455
I choose you...

20
01:58.455 --> 02:01.506
My dear husband.

21
02:06.920 --> 02:08.106
Yo!

22
02:12.638 --> 02:13.906
Yo!

23
02:17.400 --> 02:18.813
Yo...

24
02:24.520 --> 02:26.513
Keep your voice down.

25
02:27.412 --> 02:30.006
Or hell might find you.

26
02:43.800 --> 02:45.013
Yo...

27
02:47.400 --> 02:49.400
Pam!

28
02:49.400 --> 02:50.820
In the mirror!

29
02:52.480 --> 02:54.620
It's strangling Nat through the mirror!

30
03:07.840 --> 03:10.013
Let him go, you crazy ghost!

31
03:15.520 --> 03:16.720
Nat!

32
03:17.880 --> 03:18.920
Nat!

33
03:18.920 --> 03:20.506
Are you okay?

34
03:21.800 --> 03:24.713
We should get Nat out of here.

35
03:38.080 --> 03:40.638
Wherever you run, you can't escape us!

36
03:40.638 --> 03:43.500
Because I'll do to you what you did to us!

37
04:10.000 --> 04:15.009
Now... you'll taste the same suffering we did!

38
04:56.000 --> 04:59.403
You think you can escape, Sroi?

39
05:21.240 --> 05:25.013
Will you cut it yourself, or should I do it for you?

40
06:31.800 --> 06:33.513
Where am I?

41
06:37.600 --> 06:39.120
Help!

42
06:41.200 --> 06:43.419
Somebody help me!

43
06:53.480 --> 06:55.513
Pete! Help me!

44
06:57.760 --> 06:59.213
Pete!

45
06:59.920 --> 07:01.280
Can you hear me?

46
07:01.280 --> 07:04.960
[ICU 3 - Yotaka Thanahirankit] [Dr. Atchariya Pengyasa]

47
07:28.240 --> 07:30.000
Yes, Uncle?

48
07:30.000 --> 07:33.293
I tried to help Yo, but I couldn't.

49
07:33.293 --> 07:35.566
Please hurry and help her.

50
07:35.566 --> 07:38.013
But Yo's in the hospital.

51
07:38.960 --> 07:40.630
That's just her body.

52
07:40.630 --> 07:43.013
Her spirit is still trapped there.

53
07:44.120 --> 07:46.290
What should I do?

54
07:46.290 --> 07:48.539
Focus your mind.

55
07:48.539 --> 07:50.513
Think only of Yo.

56
07:53.000 --> 07:54.313
Yes, Uncle.

57
08:29.848 --> 08:31.113
Yo!

58
08:35.160 --> 08:36.513
Pete!

59
08:38.280 --> 08:39.606
Yo.

60
08:44.320 --> 08:45.910
How did this happen?

61
08:50.320 --> 08:52.306
I think I'm trapped here.

62
08:54.080 --> 08:56.206
You two must stay here!

63
08:58.000 --> 09:01.800
No... Yo and I won't stay here.

64
09:01.800 --> 09:04.840
Neither of us owes you any karmic debt.

65
09:04.840 --> 09:07.013
Why are you keeping us here?

66
09:11.440 --> 09:15.413
Yo... focus. Come back with me.

67
09:18.484 --> 09:20.813
You'll never escape!

68
09:24.000 --> 09:25.313
Yo!

69
09:31.010 --> 09:32.306
Yo!

70
09:33.160 --> 09:34.480
Yo!

71
09:36.381 --> 09:37.713
Yo!

72
09:41.400 --> 09:42.800
Go back!

73
09:43.810 --> 09:44.920
No!

74
09:50.640 --> 09:52.600
I'm going to find Yo.

75
09:53.640 --> 09:55.400
I love her.

76
09:56.400 --> 10:00.313
Just as Pan loved Sali.

77
10:06.000 --> 10:08.206
Please let me take Yo back.

78
10:13.617 --> 10:15.200
Let Yo and me go.

79
10:15.200 --> 10:16.613
You know very well...

80
10:18.080 --> 10:21.020
Yo never meant you any harm.

81
10:24.400 --> 10:26.313
Please let Yo go.

82
10:34.000 --> 10:35.413
I'll let her go.

83
10:36.907 --> 10:39.260
But she might not go back with you.

84
10:39.260 --> 10:40.813
Because she loves Lert.

85
10:48.880 --> 10:50.100
Kadkao!

86
10:53.560 --> 10:56.353
Kadkao... I love you, Kadkao.

87
10:56.353 --> 10:58.800
Don't leave me like this, Kadkao.

88
10:59.800 --> 11:02.106
I'll bring you back to life, Kadkao.

89
11:12.360 --> 11:14.461
Help me!

90
11:14.461 --> 11:16.000
Help me!

91
11:16.000 --> 11:18.400
Whoever brings Kadkao back to life,

92
11:18.400 --> 11:20.400
I'll give them ten chang!

93
11:30.800 --> 11:31.920
Kadkao...

94
11:32.680 --> 11:34.733
I love you, Kadkao.

95
11:34.733 --> 11:36.606
You mustn't leave me.

96
11:39.120 --> 11:41.540
I'll take you to a shaman.

97
11:41.540 --> 11:44.113
I'll find a way to bring you back.

98
11:47.200 --> 11:49.040
Master.

99
11:49.040 --> 11:51.013
Have you gone mad?

100
11:51.880 --> 11:54.050
Trying to bring the dead back to life?

101
11:54.050 --> 11:55.643
I'm not mad.

102
11:55.643 --> 11:57.460
I love Kadkao.

103
11:57.460 --> 11:59.206
What about me?

104
12:00.840 --> 12:02.680
Have you forgotten?

105
12:02.680 --> 12:05.606
We got married because our families arranged it.

106
12:06.400 --> 12:11.106
Did you ever love me at all, Master?

107
12:13.600 --> 12:17.318
Kadkao is the only one in my heart.

108
12:21.040 --> 12:22.505
Master...

109
12:24.600 --> 12:26.830
I'll take you to a shaman.

110
12:26.830 --> 12:29.204
I'll find a way to bring you back.

111
12:34.200 --> 12:35.305
Bulan, don't!

112
12:35.305 --> 12:36.680
Bulan, don't!

113
12:36.680 --> 12:37.961
Bulan, don't!

114
12:37.961 --> 12:39.080
Bulan, don't!

115
12:39.080 --> 12:41.800
- Bulan, don't... Don't! - Let go!

116
12:41.800 --> 12:43.506
- Don't! - Let go!

117
12:44.440 --> 12:46.213
I said stop it!

118
12:48.920 --> 12:50.213
Master!

119
12:56.600 --> 12:58.360
Bulan, don't!

120
12:58.360 --> 12:59.720
Don't!

121
13:02.668 --> 13:07.600
Bulan, stop! That's enough, Bulan!

122
13:07.600 --> 13:09.607
Stop this madness!

123
13:12.120 --> 13:13.908
Stop this madness!

124
13:19.040 --> 13:24.554
My lady, please don't! Please stop! I'm begging you!

125
13:24.554 --> 13:27.017
Get out of my way, Sroi!

126
13:29.800 --> 13:31.930
I said get out of my way!

127
13:31.930 --> 13:36.303
No, ma'am! My lady, please don't hurt Master Lert!

128
13:37.320 --> 13:38.843
I told you to get out of my way!

129
13:38.843 --> 13:42.606
Master Lert, run! Run!

130
13:43.800 --> 13:45.563
Go, sir!

131
13:45.563 --> 13:46.800
Let go of me!

132
13:46.800 --> 13:49.160
Master... Master!

133
13:49.160 --> 13:51.400
- Let go! - No! I won't, ma'am!

134
13:51.400 --> 13:52.680
Let go of me!

135
13:52.680 --> 13:53.920
Let go!

136
13:57.307 --> 13:59.706
Do you love him more than me?

137
14:03.280 --> 14:04.763
No, ma'am.

138
14:04.763 --> 14:07.800
I just don't want you to hurt Master Lert.

139
14:09.160 --> 14:10.713
I don't believe you!

140
14:31.800 --> 14:37.710
In this life, I've loved and revered you, my lady.

141
14:39.080 --> 14:41.796
But if there's a next life...

142
14:42.960 --> 14:46.006
I'll choose to love myself.

143
14:47.200 --> 14:48.440
And I'll...

144
14:48.440 --> 14:53.810
I'll never let you hurt me again.

145
14:55.480 --> 14:56.713
Sroi!

146
15:16.080 --> 15:20.013
Somebody, please help Kadkao!

147
15:21.320 --> 15:23.516
Help Kadkao!

148
15:24.720 --> 15:27.606
Somebody, help me!

149
15:30.320 --> 15:31.843
Kadkao...

150
15:31.843 --> 15:34.480
I love you, Kadkao.

151
15:34.480 --> 15:37.713
Don't leave me, Kadkao.

152
16:03.800 --> 16:05.100
Kadkao...

153
16:59.120 --> 17:00.606
Master...

154
17:03.360 --> 17:05.406
Do you know, Master...

155
17:07.440 --> 17:10.013
When you hurt,

156
17:12.840 --> 17:15.506
I hurt even more than you do.

157
17:18.200 --> 17:20.210
May this be...

158
17:22.135 --> 17:25.306
the last pain we ever share.

159
17:44.440 --> 17:46.010
Kadkao...

160
18:41.880 --> 18:43.713
Master...

161
18:46.080 --> 18:48.606
You killed me...

162
18:49.680 --> 18:51.200
Master...

163
19:18.640 --> 19:22.896
In the end, your love has made you turn on each other.

164
19:28.960 --> 19:30.706
How satisfying!

165
19:31.480 --> 19:36.303
And now you'll take our places in death.

166
19:36.920 --> 19:41.305
And your corpses will feed the vultures and crows.

167
19:45.440 --> 19:48.625
My curse still stands!

168
19:53.360 --> 19:58.893
You'll never be reborn for a hundred lifetimes!

169
19:59.480 --> 20:01.013
- Bastard Lert! - Bastard Lert!

170
20:41.800 --> 20:44.010
I'll lift the curse on all of you.

171
20:51.120 --> 20:53.100
- Yo! - Nat!

172
20:53.805 --> 20:55.120
Let go of my wife, now!

173
20:55.120 --> 20:57.160
Why should I listen to you?

174
20:57.160 --> 20:58.840
Yo has nothing to do with this.

175
20:58.840 --> 21:00.906
She's Kadkao!

176
21:01.720 --> 21:04.091
What did Kadkao ever do to you?

177
21:04.091 --> 21:06.960
She's Lert's beloved!

178
21:06.960 --> 21:08.040
Yes...

179
21:08.040 --> 21:10.700
No matter the lifetime, I'll always love this woman.

180
21:12.720 --> 21:15.116
Will you trade your life for hers?

181
21:16.200 --> 21:17.620
How?

182
21:18.440 --> 21:21.080
You die, she lives!

183
21:21.080 --> 21:23.606
You live, she dies!

184
21:26.040 --> 21:29.793
Hey! Don't! I give up! I'm willing to die!

185
21:29.793 --> 21:34.213
Nat... No! If we die, we die together!

186
21:39.520 --> 21:41.413
But Yo has nothing to do with this.

187
21:42.400 --> 21:45.020
I'm begging you. Let her go.

188
21:47.480 --> 21:49.909
These two have nothing to do with this. Let them go.

189
21:51.800 --> 21:54.813
You... Lift the curse. Now!

190
22:02.400 --> 22:04.336
This doll...

191
22:04.336 --> 22:07.440
has been passed down through generations to my father.

192
22:07.440 --> 22:10.910
It's an ancient family heirloom.

193
22:10.910 --> 22:13.210
Take good care of it, Nat.

194
22:14.360 --> 22:15.710
Yes, Dad.

195
22:27.360 --> 22:29.113
I truly repent.

196
22:30.240 --> 22:31.805
I ask for forgiveness.

197
22:31.805 --> 22:33.787
I hereby lift the curse.

198
22:33.787 --> 22:35.903
May the souls of Pan...

199
22:36.760 --> 22:37.803
Yohd...

200
22:39.040 --> 22:40.406
and Sali...

201
22:41.800 --> 22:43.406
find peace in the afterlife.

202
23:19.200 --> 23:22.120
I've suffered for over a hundred years.

203
23:22.120 --> 23:26.200
Cursed and branded as sexual deviants.

204
23:26.200 --> 23:29.400
All I'll give you is endless vengeance!

205
23:33.040 --> 23:36.080
He's lifted the curse. Let them go.

206
23:36.080 --> 23:38.040
Just like that?

207
23:38.040 --> 23:41.200
After we've suffered for over a century?

208
23:41.200 --> 23:44.886
It's that simple. You can finally be free.

209
23:44.886 --> 23:46.681
Let go of your hatred.

210
23:46.681 --> 23:48.510
Forgive and move on.

211
23:49.840 --> 23:53.015
You must know I only want what's best for you.

212
23:53.015 --> 23:54.720
You're my family.

213
23:54.720 --> 23:56.080
No matter what...

214
23:56.080 --> 23:57.800
I still love you.

215
24:00.040 --> 24:02.413
I want your souls to find peace.

216
24:07.680 --> 24:10.313
Even after everything I've done to you?

217
24:11.480 --> 24:14.600
I understand your anger and resentment.

218
24:14.600 --> 24:16.306
Go in peace.

219
24:17.895 --> 24:20.680
Don't carry this vengeance into another life.

220
24:20.680 --> 24:25.713
At least then, you won't have to suffer anymore.

221
24:42.520 --> 24:45.806
Hurry! Take Yo back before it's too late!

222
24:47.360 --> 24:49.800
Nat... You have to get back into your body.

223
24:49.800 --> 24:51.600
I'm worried about you.

224
24:52.480 --> 24:54.160
Go back, Yo.

225
24:54.160 --> 24:56.406
I don't want you to die, no matter what.

226
24:57.240 --> 25:00.513
Hurry! Take Yo back before it's too late!

227
25:13.920 --> 25:17.960
[Police Station for the People]

228
25:35.760 --> 25:36.800
Pete.

229
25:37.920 --> 25:39.906
The forensic results are in.

230
25:40.680 --> 25:41.913
What do they say?

231
25:42.880 --> 25:45.206
Nat, Pam, and Whan

232
25:45.206 --> 25:47.500
really did conspire to drug Yo.

233
25:47.500 --> 25:49.213
All three are going to be arrested.

234
25:59.000 --> 26:02.856
- Hello? - This is the hospital calling.

235
26:02.856 --> 26:06.194
We have an update on Yotaka's condition.

236
26:06.194 --> 26:08.200
How is she?

237
26:08.200 --> 26:11.460
[Intensive Care Unit (ICU)]

238
26:11.460 --> 26:14.606
I'm so glad you're awake.

239
26:19.760 --> 26:22.013
There's something else I need to tell you.

240
26:26.640 --> 26:30.200
Nat, Pam, and Whan...

241
26:31.640 --> 26:34.000
They're all guilty of drugging you.

242
26:34.000 --> 26:36.016
It nearly killed you.

243
26:49.796 --> 26:51.416
I'm worried about Nat.

244
26:52.640 --> 26:54.813
Is there any way you can help him?

245
27:06.880 --> 27:08.613
Come on, smile! Let's make a video.

246
27:09.640 --> 27:12.000
Something to remember this by.

247
27:12.000 --> 27:13.446
Do you love me?

248
27:13.446 --> 27:17.520
I do! Let's make a video like this every year. What do you think?

249
27:17.520 --> 27:19.160
- Sounds good. - Isn't that sweet?

250
27:19.160 --> 27:20.996
Of course! I'd love that.

251
27:21.880 --> 27:23.200
I love you, Yo.

252
27:23.200 --> 27:25.200
- I love you too, Nat. - Yo...

253
27:25.200 --> 27:27.503
- Hmm? - Let's have a baby.

254
27:27.503 --> 27:29.160
- Are you serious? - I am!

255
27:29.160 --> 27:31.551
I'd say... two kids would be enough.

256
27:31.551 --> 27:32.806
What should we name them?

257
27:33.960 --> 27:35.040
Home.

258
27:35.040 --> 27:36.240
Home?

259
27:36.240 --> 27:40.560
Because coming home should always make us happy, right, Nat?

260
27:40.560 --> 27:41.941
Okay, okay. What about the younger one?

261
27:41.941 --> 27:43.480
- House. - House?

262
27:43.480 --> 27:46.503
- Home and House? Like that? - Yes!

263
27:48.280 --> 27:50.040
I'm ready. Shall we get started?

264
27:50.040 --> 27:51.906
Right now?

265
28:01.960 --> 28:05.413
Thank you for everything we've shared, Nat.

266
28:11.560 --> 28:13.613
But for the rest of my life...

267
28:21.200 --> 28:25.006
I'll love myself more than I ever loved you.

268
29:28.360 --> 29:30.113
I'm still alive?

269
29:40.400 --> 29:41.706
Pam.

270
30:00.880 --> 30:02.813
You're safe too, right?

271
30:07.120 --> 30:09.204
I've made up my mind.

272
30:09.204 --> 30:10.513
I'm going to become a monk.

273
30:13.480 --> 30:15.316
How can you become a monk?

274
30:16.280 --> 30:18.060
Don't pretend you don't know.

275
30:18.060 --> 30:20.220
The police are coming to arrest us!

276
30:20.880 --> 30:22.840
We have to run, Nat!

277
30:22.840 --> 30:24.713
You have to get me out of here!

278
30:25.360 --> 30:27.000
No.

279
30:27.000 --> 30:30.213
If I have to go to prison, so be it.

280
30:31.640 --> 30:33.400
But I'm not!

281
30:33.400 --> 30:34.740
That's up to you.

282
30:34.740 --> 30:36.306
Where are you going?

283
30:37.720 --> 30:39.399
I'm going to see Yo.

284
30:41.240 --> 30:43.240
Have you lost your mind?

285
30:43.240 --> 30:46.920
After everything you did to Yo, she'll never come back to you!

286
30:48.600 --> 30:50.103
I finally realize...

287
30:50.880 --> 30:55.305
In the past or in this life, Yo is the only woman I've ever loved.

288
30:57.760 --> 31:00.220
And I'll do whatever it takes to win her back.

289
31:04.840 --> 31:05.920
Nat!

290
31:15.800 --> 31:17.256
Pam!

291
31:17.256 --> 31:20.006
Bulan was a fool who worshipped love.

292
31:20.640 --> 31:22.313
But I'm not!

293
31:22.880 --> 31:25.026
If you don't love me...

294
31:25.026 --> 31:26.906
If you won't choose me...

295
31:27.480 --> 31:29.080
Then die!

296
31:29.080 --> 31:30.420
Die!

297
32:12.760 --> 32:15.613
Whan... Help me!

298
32:29.600 --> 32:31.528
Are you out of your mind?

299
32:31.528 --> 32:33.506
Why would you stab me?

300
32:34.280 --> 32:36.113
You killed me...

301
33:10.297 --> 33:11.800
Nat!

302
33:11.800 --> 33:13.360
Nat!

303
33:13.360 --> 33:15.920
Nat! Please... Please don't die!

304
33:15.920 --> 33:18.316
Nat... Nat!

305
33:29.120 --> 33:30.206
Nat!

306
33:37.279 --> 33:38.600
Nat!

307
35:40.800 --> 35:43.210
What the hell am I supposed to put in my report?

308
35:43.210 --> 35:47.640
That some unseen force made them kill themselves?

309
35:47.640 --> 35:50.240
We have to go by the evidence.

310
35:50.240 --> 35:55.015
For now, we'll officially classify the deaths as suicides.

311
35:58.200 --> 35:59.509
Look, man...

312
36:00.240 --> 36:02.610
Some cases can only be closed on paper.

313
36:03.600 --> 36:06.280
But those who were there that night...

314
36:06.280 --> 36:08.111
know what really happened.

315
36:11.760 --> 36:13.305
Let's go with that.

316
36:33.400 --> 36:35.920
So, according to the autopsy report...

317
36:35.920 --> 36:39.312
there really was no one else at the scene, right, Pete?

318
36:41.680 --> 36:44.472
Forensics confirmed there were no unidentified fingerprints

319
36:44.472 --> 36:47.317
or DNA from a fourth person at the scene.

320
36:48.520 --> 36:51.157
All evidence points to them attacking one another,

321
36:51.157 --> 36:53.915
ultimately ending in suicide.

322
36:58.200 --> 37:00.800
But what happened here doesn't look like suicide.

323
37:03.640 --> 37:07.213
It's more like some unseen force was controlling them.

324
37:08.065 --> 37:09.213
Exactly.

325
37:11.109 --> 37:16.904
From a forensic standpoint, every wound has a distinct injury mechanism.

326
37:16.904 --> 37:20.061
The force of the knife, the angle of the stab...

327
37:20.061 --> 37:22.809
They must be consistent with human muscle movement.

328
37:24.880 --> 37:28.312
But their wounds defy the laws of nature.

329
37:30.040 --> 37:32.712
Science only documents what we can see.

330
37:33.760 --> 37:37.600
But what we experienced was supernatural.

331
37:37.600 --> 37:39.600
I don't understand.

332
37:39.600 --> 37:41.474
They'd already forgiven each other.

333
37:41.474 --> 37:42.956
And Uncle Chan confirmed

334
37:42.956 --> 37:46.198
that those spirits had finally found peace, didn't he?

335
37:50.120 --> 37:54.808
As a cop, I know that once a complaint is dropped, the case is closed.

336
37:55.840 --> 38:00.480
But when it comes to karma, I'm not so sure anymore.

337
38:00.480 --> 38:04.583
Can spirits imprisoned for over a hundred years

338
38:04.583 --> 38:07.804
really end it all with a single word of forgiveness?

339
38:09.886 --> 38:11.731
Or perhaps...

340
38:11.731 --> 38:14.400
they were merely witnesses,

341
38:14.400 --> 38:18.308
letting the living destroy each other, driven by their old nature.

342
38:21.600 --> 38:23.213
So, what are you going to do now?

343
38:24.880 --> 38:29.615
After Nat's funeral, I think I'll move somewhere else.

344
38:44.920 --> 38:48.885
And this will be the final livestream on this channel.

345
38:48.885 --> 38:51.120
Because I've started a new channel!

346
38:51.120 --> 38:53.000
It's called Voices from the Dark.

347
38:53.000 --> 38:57.025
[I will!] Don't forget to like and subscribe!

348
38:57.025 --> 38:58.617
[Will it be even scarier?] Bye-bye!

349
39:06.360 --> 39:09.232
I hadn't posted any updates in a long time.

350
39:09.232 --> 39:12.800
When I checked, my followers had been asking about it nonstop.

351
39:12.800 --> 39:16.450
They asked about my early ghost videos at the great-grandfather's house.

352
39:16.450 --> 39:20.010
So I decided to do one final livestream for them.

353
39:26.240 --> 39:30.909
Speaking of which, I miss Whan and Aunt Nong too.

354
39:32.680 --> 39:35.016
They both used to work for me.

355
39:36.240 --> 39:40.709
And then there's Pam and Nat, who used to own this house.

356
39:42.680 --> 39:44.440
It's all in the past now.

357
39:44.440 --> 39:46.511
Don't dwell on it too much.

358
39:48.000 --> 39:50.009
Didn't you say life must go on?

359
39:54.000 --> 39:57.632
I may not be able to erase your painful memories,

360
39:57.632 --> 39:59.714
but I can be there for you.

361
40:00.560 --> 40:03.800
As someone who went through all of it with you.

362
40:03.800 --> 40:05.440
Someone who truly understands

363
40:05.440 --> 40:07.511
what happened that night.

364
40:09.120 --> 40:11.506
Thank you for being there for me.

365
40:14.200 --> 40:20.160
Of course... And I promise I'll always be by your side.

366
40:20.160 --> 40:21.714
If you'll let me.

367
40:23.240 --> 40:25.314
Why wouldn't I?

368
40:26.240 --> 40:28.420
Friendship is a beautiful thing.

369
40:34.840 --> 40:36.428
It's time to go. [Who are those three?]

370
40:37.000 --> 40:38.280
Let the rest [Cosplayers?]

371
40:38.280 --> 40:41.005
be settled by those who take our place. [Goosebumps!]

372
40:50.880 --> 40:52.718
Did you hear something?

373
40:53.880 --> 40:55.410
No, I didn't.

374
41:00.320 --> 41:02.413
Speaking of Nat...

375
41:02.413 --> 41:04.518
Shall we go make merit for them?

376
41:07.360 --> 41:08.801
I'd like that.
